 uction and production of video games\, plus support for collective operati
 ons such as events. ELIGIBILITY: games companies established in France\; s
 uitable for studios\, not individual artists. APPLY to the CNC by each ses
 sion deadline\; a committee reviews about two months later.\n\nOrganisatio
 n: CNC (Centre national du cinema et de l'image animee)\nLocation: France.
  Games companies established in France.\nAward: No fixed figure: up to 100
  percent of costs for writing\, 50 percent for pre-production and producti
 on. The June 2026 session awarded EUR 10\,000 per writing project\, EUR 25
 \,000 to 150\,000 for pre-production and EUR 80\,000 to 200\,000 for produ
 ction. No application fee.\nDuration: Project-based\; committee meets abou
 t 2 months after each deadline\n\nMore: https://www.cnc.fr/professionnels/
 aides-et-financements/jeu-video/fonds-d-aide-au-jeu-video-fajv-_191468?utm
