  a clear connection to LGBTQ+ themes and sexual\, gender and cultural dive
 rsity\, for its edition of 10-21 March 2027.\n\nOrganisation: Roze Filmdag
 en (Amsterdam LGBTQ+ Film Festival)\nLocation: Amsterdam\, Netherlands (30
 th edition\, 10-21 March 2027). Open to filmmakers worldwide.\nAward: Cash
  prizes (amounts not published): Jury Awards and Audience Awards for best 
 feature\, best documentary and best short\, plus the Free to be Me Award (
 initiated by Hivos). Roze Filmdagen is a nominating festival for the Iris 
 Prize (Cardiff). Listed under the desk's festival exception. Submission fe
 e: none in the 2025 and 2026 editions\; the 2027 FilmFreeway fee could not
  be confirmed.\nDuration: Festival 10-21 March 2027\n\nMore: https://rozef
 ilmdagen.nl/en/news/inzendingen-2027?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk
