 ons headquartered in Germany or abroad may apply.\nAward: No fixed ceiling
 \, but total project costs must exceed EUR 50\,000 to be eligible. The Fou
 ndation allocates up to EUR 10 million per year across this line. At least
  20 percent of total project costs must be secured from own capital and/or
  third-party funding. No application fee.\nDuration: Project-length. Proje
 cts may not begin before the jury meeting.\n\nMore: https://www.kulturstif
 tung-des-bundes.de/en/themes_focuses/general_project_funding.html?utm_sour
 ce=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
